        <detaileddescription>
<para>In <computeroutput>VM_counting</computeroutput> mode, it simply counts the number of select instructions. In <computeroutput>VM_instrument</computeroutput> mode, it inserts code to count the number times TrueValue of select is taken. In <computeroutput>VM_annotate</computeroutput> mode, it reads the profile data and annotate the select instruction with metadata. </para>
